:"墓主","video_desc":"深夜直播，一条弹幕令阮阮脊背发凉，“你们住的是棺材房。”无窗的宿舍每逢雨天便会渗水，而室友中，藏着一位早已死去的“墓主”。今夜是第一百天，天亮前找不出她，所有人都会死。可当阮阮开始调查，弹幕突然中断，整层楼陷入死循环——最想让她活着的，竟是那个“人”。","series_id":"7621823290666912793","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062330281B30F4DE21440A8EF7F2\",\"rank\":\"7\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7621823290666912793\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.040845710784196854,\\\"like\\\":0.05582313612103462,\\\"finish\\\":0.0034834237303584814,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.027586612850427628,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.147317886352539,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.11575839668512344,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7849090099334717}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7621823290666912793","play_cnt":152703,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"快创短剧","sub_title":"惊悚·惊悚灵异","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":72,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5132,\"name\":\"惊悚\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5132&categoryName=惊悚&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5377,\"name\":\"惊悚灵异\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5377&categoryName=惊悚灵异&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5252,\"name\":\"直播\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5252&categoryName=直播&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5260,\"name\":\"大女主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5260&categoryName=大女主&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5217,\"name\":\"主播\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5217&categoryName=主播&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5315,\"name\":\"校园\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5315&categoryName=校园&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"drago